   $q$Listen. Gus the goat lived on a small farm. Gus loved to climb on top of everything: the fence, the wagon, and even the barn! One day, Gus climbed up onto the barn roof and could not get down. The farmer brought a tall ladder, and Gus walked down slowly. Gus was very glad to stand on the grass again. After that, Gus climbed only on the fence. Who is the main character in this story? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"goat","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"goat","count":1}},{"text":"sheep","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"sheep","count":1}},{"text":"horse","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"horse","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$goat$q$, $q$The beginning tells us about Gus the goat, and the whole story is about Gus climbing. Gus the goat is the main character.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
