   $q$Listen. Mia and Dev wanted the shiny red apples at the top of the tree. The apples looked so sweet and juicy. Mia jumped as high as possible. Dev climbed onto a big rock and reached up with both arms. Their fingers still did not touch even one apple. Then Grandpa came out of the house with a ladder. Soon they picked a whole bucket of apples. What was the problem in this story? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"There was no tree.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"There was no tree."}},{"text":"The apples fell.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"The apples fell."}},{"text":"Apples were high up.","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Apples were high up."}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Apples were high up.$q$, $q$Mia jumped and Dev reached, but they could not touch the apples. The apples were too high. Grandpa's ladder solved the problem.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
