   $q$Listen. Ruby got a new bike for a birthday. Ruby rode it to the park, but the front tire went flat. Ruby had to walk the bike all the way home, feeling sad. Dad found a tiny hole in the tire and fixed it with a patch. The next day, Ruby rode to the park again, as fast as the wind. What broke in this story? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"car","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"car","count":1}},{"text":"bike","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"bike","count":1}},{"text":"wagon","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"wagon","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$bike$q$, $q$The problem was the bike's flat tire. At the end, Dad fixed it, and Ruby could ride the bike to the park again.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
