   $q$Listen. Once upon a time, a little owl named Hoot lived in a tall tree in the woods. Hoot was afraid of the dark, and that is hard for an owl! Every night, Hoot hid in a hole in the tree. Then a firefly friend came and lit up the sky. After that, Hoot flew out every night to see the stars. Which part tells us who Hoot is and where Hoot lives? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"middle","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"middle"}},{"text":"beginning","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"beginning"}},{"text":"end","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"end"}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$beginning$q$, $q$The beginning of a story tells who and where. The first sentence tells us Hoot is a little owl who lives in a tall tree in the woods.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
