   $q$Listen. Duck and Pig went to the pond on a very hot day. The sun was shining bright. Duck jumped right in with a big splash. "Come in, the water is nice and cool!" said Duck. Pig dipped one toe into the pond. "Brr! It is too cold for me!" said Pig. Pig rolled in the warm mud instead, and both friends were happy. Who said, it is too cold for me? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"cow","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"cow","count":1}},{"text":"pig","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"pig","count":1}},{"text":"duck","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"duck","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$pig$q$, $q$Duck liked the cool water. The story says, it is too cold for me, said Pig. The two friends thought differently about the same pond.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
