   $q$Listen. Leo and Ana went to the beach with Uncle Ray. The sand was warm, and the water sparkled. A big wave came crashing in. Leo laughed and jumped right into the wave. Ana screamed and ran up the sand, holding a pail tight. "That wave is way too big!" Ana cried. Leo waved from the water, but Ana stayed far up on the dry sand. How did Ana feel about the big wave? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"happy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}},{"text":"scared","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_scared","count":1}},{"text":"sleepy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_tired","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$scared$q$, $q$Ana screamed, ran away, and said the wave was too big. Ana felt scared. Leo felt happy and jumped in. They felt differently about the same wave.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
