   $q$Listen. Bo the bear was taking a long winter nap in a cozy den. A noisy bird landed on top of the den and sang and sang. Bo woke up, rubbed both eyes, and frowned a big frown. "Go away! I am trying to sleep!" Bo grumbled. The bird flew off to sing somewhere else, and Bo curled up and went back to sleep. What voice should you use for Bo's words? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"grumpy","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_mad","count":1}},{"text":"scared","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_scared","count":1}},{"text":"happy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$grumpy$q$, $q$Bo frowned and grumbled, go away, I am trying to sleep. Bo was woken up and felt grumpy, so read those words in a grumpy voice.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
