   $q$Listen. Rain poured down on the farm all day long. Big drops dripped off the roof, and the puddles got bigger and bigger. Cat sat under the porch, wet and grumpy. "I do not like getting wet," said Cat. But Duck splashed in every puddle and quacked a happy song. "Rain is the best!" said Duck. Hen stayed dry inside the barn and took a long nap in the hay. Which animal loved the rain? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"cat","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"cat","count":1}},{"text":"hen","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"hen","count":1}},{"text":"duck","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"duck","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$duck$q$, $q$Duck splashed in puddles and said, rain is the best. Duck loved the rain. Cat did not like getting wet, so Cat felt differently.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
