   $q$Listen. A loud storm rolled over the farm. Boom went the thunder! The wind howled, and rain hit the barn roof. Dog hid under the porch and shook all over. Horse stood in the barn and kept munching hay, not bothered one bit. Cow mooed by the window, wanting to watch the flashes of lightning. Soon the storm passed, and the sun came out again. Which animal was scared of the storm? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"horse","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"horse","count":1}},{"text":"cow","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"cow","count":1}},{"text":"dog","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"dog","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$dog$q$, $q$Dog hid and shook all over, so Dog was scared. Horse kept eating, and Cow wanted to watch. Each animal felt differently about the same storm.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
