   $q$Listen. The class went on a trip to the aquarium. Big sharks swam slowly in a huge tank. Hugo pressed close to the glass to see the sharks. "Wow, sharks are so cool!" said Hugo. Tess stood far back and held the teacher's hand tight. Tess had read that sharks have rows and rows of sharp teeth. Hugo and Tess looked at the very same sharks. Why did Tess stay far back? Tap the answer.$q$, $q$[{"text":"Tess was sleepy.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Tess was sleepy."}},{"text":"Tess was hungry.","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Tess was hungry."}},{"text":"Tess felt scared.","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"word","value":"Tess felt scared."}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Tess felt scared.$q$, $q$Tess held on tight and thought about sharp teeth, so Tess felt scared. Hugo thought the sharks were cool. They saw the same sharks but felt differently.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
