   $q$Listen. Ollie and Kate both painted pictures for the art show. Ollie painted a bright red barn, and Kate painted a sunset. Kate's painting won a blue ribbon. Kate jumped up and cheered. Everyone clapped. Ollie looked down at the floor, because Ollie had wanted to win too. Then Kate walked over. "Your painting has the best colors!" Kate said. Ollie smiled a little smile. How did Ollie feel when Kate won the ribbon? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"sad","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_sad","count":1}},{"text":"scared","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_scared","count":1}},{"text":"happy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$sad$q$, $q$Kate cheered, but Ollie looked at the floor because Ollie wanted to win too. Ollie felt sad. Kind words from Kate helped Ollie smile later.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
