   $q$Listen. A big spider spun a web in the corner of the porch. The web shone in the morning sun. Nina saw it and ran inside. "Get it away!" Nina yelled. Nina's grandma bent down to take a close look. "What a beautiful web," Grandma said with a smile. "Many spiders eat bugs that bother us." Then Nina came back out for a closer look. How did Grandma feel about the spider? Tap the picture.$q$, $q$[{"text":"scared","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_scared","count":1}},{"text":"happy","is_correct":true,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_happy","count":1}},{"text":"grumpy","is_correct":false,"tile":{"kind":"object_group","image":"face_mad","count":1}}]$q$::jsonb, $q$happy$q$, $q$Nina yelled and ran, but Grandma smiled and called the web beautiful. Grandma felt happy about the spider. Nina and Grandma felt differently.$q$, 'draft', null, 'audio_picture', null)
